(text "The display board: four ИН-12А, two ИН-17, two ИН-15, two ИНС-1 and nine LEDs - and nothing else.\nEvery line reaches it from the driver board through the pin strips XP11, XP12 and XP21-XP25.\nEvery net is named as on the board."
(exclude_from_sim no)
